{"seq":6,"slug":"causal-inference","title":"因果推断","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":6,"docCount":21,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference","rating":{"composite":3.59,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.37,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 因果推断 简介\n\n因果推断是数据科学中最具理论深度的领域之一。\"相关不等于因果\"是每个数据从业者都熟悉的警句，但如何从数据中真正识别因果关系，需要严格的方法论框架。从政策评估到产品优化，因果推断能力使数据科学家能够回答\"为什么\"和\"如果改变会怎样\"这类关键问题。\n\n本知识库系统构建因果推断的完整知识体系，面向数据科学家、经济学背景的分析师和需要评估干预效果的技术人员。\n\n第1章**因果推断基础**建立因果思维的理论框架，介绍因果与相关的本质区别、潜在结果框架和因果图等核心概念。\n\n第2章**实验方法**讲解通过主动干预建立因果关系的方法，涵盖随机对照试验、准实验方法和自然实验的设计与分析。\n\n第3章**观测方法**探讨在无法进行随机实验时如何从观测数据中推断因果关系，包括匹配方法、工具变量法和双重差分等经典技术。\n\n第4章**因果推断应用**将方法论与实践结合，介绍因果机器学习、提升建模和策略评估等前沿应用方向。\n\n建议读者从第1章的理论框架开始，建立因果思维后再学习具体方法，最后通过应用章节理解方法的落地场景。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"causal-fundamentals","title":"因果推断基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"causality-vs-correlation","title":"因果关系与相关关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-fundamentals/causality-vs-correlation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"potential-outcomes","title":"潜在结果框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-fundamentals/potential-outcomes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"causal-graphs","title":"因果图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-fundamentals/causal-graphs"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"causal-methods","title":"因果推断方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"matching-methods","title":"匹配方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-methods/matching-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"difference-in-differences","title":"双重差分法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-methods/difference-in-differences"},{"seq":3,"slug":"iv-regression-discontinuity","title":"工具变量与断点回归","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-methods/iv-regression-discontinuity"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"causal-ml","title":"因果推断与机器学习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-ml","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"heterogeneous-treatment-effects","title":"异质处理效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-ml/heterogeneous-treatment-effects"},{"seq":2,"slug":"synthetic-control","title":"合成控制法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-ml/synthetic-control"},{"seq":3,"slug":"causal-ml-methods","title":"因果推断与机器学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-ml/causal-ml-methods"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"causal-applications","title":"因果推断应用","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"causal-ml","title":"因果机器学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-applications/causal-ml"},{"seq":2,"slug":"causal-product-analytics","title":"因果推断与产品分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-applications/causal-product-analytics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"causal-inference-practice","title":"因果推断实践指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-applications/causal-inference-practice"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mediation-analysis","title":"中介分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-applications/mediation-analysis"},{"seq":5,"slug":"uplift-modeling","title":"Uplift 建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-applications/uplift-modeling"},{"seq":6,"slug":"policy-evaluation","title":"策略评估与反事实推理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/causal-applications/policy-evaluation"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"experimental-methods","title":"实验方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inference/experimental-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rct-design","title":"随机对照试验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/causal-inferenc